=== Bit Slicing Test ===
Test 1: Direct bit extraction
data = 0xdeadbeef
data[6:0] = 0x6f (expected: 0x6F)
data[7:0] = 0xef (expected: 0xEF)
data[15:8] = 0xbe (expected: 0xBE)
data[31:24] = 0xde (expected: 0xDE)
Test 2: Assignment to variables
bits_6_0 = 0x6f (expected: 0x6F)
bits_7_0 = 0xef (expected: 0xEF)
Test 3: RISC-V instruction decode
instruction = 0x06400093
opcode (data[6:0]) = 0x13 (expected: 0x13)
rd (data[11:7]) = 1 (expected: 1)
funct3 (data[14:12]) = 0x0 (expected: 0x0)
rs1 (data[19:15]) = 0 (expected: 0)
Via assignment:
opcode = 0x13
rd = 1
funct3 = 0x0
PASS: bit slicing works correctly
